  _subtitle: Dark woods and Kalidahs
  _description: Thick woods where the [[d66a2c64-124c-4313-8911-f67c5e0e7b01|Tin
    Woodman]] stood rusted for a year, and where the [[d2eb523f-1396-4e40-91d2-4927aa29cf9b|Cowardly
    Lion]] jumps out at the travelers. Beyond the great ditches live the Kalidahs.
